### Pack catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/packs
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Install the online-shop pack, with its catalog feed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packs/ecommerce/install
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "catalogUrl": "https://shop.example.uz/api/products",
  "catalogItemsPath": "$.data"
}

### Install without a catalog — add it later through /api/knowledge-base/sources
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packs/ecommerce/install
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Then set the secrets the answer lists as missing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/secrets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "key": "SHOP_API_URL",
  "value": "https://shop.example.uz/api",
  "description": "Magazin API manzili"
}

### Generate a pack for a business the catalog has no pack for (E.1) — creates nothing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packs/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "business": "Men gul do'koniman. Mijozlar qo'ng'iroq qilib buket buyurtma qiladi, yetkazib berish Toshkent bo'ylab. Ish vaqti 9 dan 21 gacha. Yetkazib berish 30 ming so'm. Bayram kunlari oldindan buyurtma olamiz.",
  "openApiUrl": "https://gullar.example.uz/openapi.json",
  "secretPrefix": "FLOWERS",
  "language": "uz-UZ"
}

### Without an API — a pack whose result is recorded in the conversation itself
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packs/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "business": "Fitnes klubman. Sinov mashg'ulotiga yozilgan odamlarga qo'ng'iroq qilib, kelish-kelmasligini tasdiqlataman."
}

### Install the draft, as the person edited it
POST http://localhost:8080/api/packs/install-draft
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "pack": {
    "key": "gul-dokoni",
    "name": "Gul do'koni: buyurtma",
    "description": "Buket buyurtmasini qabul qiladi",
    "industry": "flowers",
    "agent": { "name": "Gul do'koni operatori", "language": "uz-UZ", "firstMessage": "...", "useRag": true, "scenario": { "stages": [], "outcomeSchema": [], "rolePrompt": "...", "guardrails": [] } },
    "tools": [],
    "testCases": [],
    "secrets": []
  }
}
